    "pin": {
      "title": "Unité d'habitation",
      "description": "Modernist style of residential housing",
      "extract": "The Unité d'habitation is a modernist residential housing typology developed by Le Corbusier, with the collaboration of painter-architect Nadir Afonso. It formed the basis of several housing developments throughout Europe designed by Le Corbusier and sharing the same name and reached prominence in the 1950s and 60s.",
